    "text": "The driver runs a 10-floor building with three cars. It shows hall calls being dispatched, cars stopping along their direction while a passenger adds a destination mid-trip, cars taken out of service, a strategy swap, and invalid requests. Each line is one tick: `E0@3^` means car 0 on floor 3 heading up, `v` is down and `.` is idle.",
    "file": "Main.java",
    "body": "import java.util.List;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        ElevatorController controller = new ElevatorController(10, 3, new NearestElevatorStrategy());\n\n        System.out.println(\"== 1. External requests are dispatched to the best car ==\");\n        System.out.println(\"hall call 5 UP   -> E\" + controller.requestElevator(5, Direction.UP));\n        System.out.println(\"hall call 3 DOWN -> E\" + controller.requestElevator(3, Direction.DOWN));\n        System.out.println(\"hall call 8 DOWN -> E\" + controller.requestElevator(8, Direction.DOWN));\n        System.out.println(controller.status());\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 2. Cars move one floor per tick and stop along their direction ==\");\n        advance(controller, 2);\n        System.out.println(\"passenger in E0 presses 9\");\n        controller.selectFloor(0, 9);\n        System.out.println(\"hall call 4 UP   -> E\" + controller.requestElevator(4, Direction.UP));\n        runUntilIdle(controller);\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 3. A car taken out of service gets no new requests ==\");\n        controller.setInService(0, false);\n        controller.setInService(1, false);\n        System.out.println(\"E0 and E1 out of service: \" + controller.status());\n        System.out.println(\"hall call 2 UP   -> E\" + controller.requestElevator(2, Direction.UP));\n        runUntilIdle(controller);\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 4. Swap the dispatch algorithm without touching the elevators ==\");\n        controller.setInService(0, true);\n        controller.setInService(1, true);\n        controller.setStrategy(new LeastLoadedStrategy());\n        System.out.println(controller.status());\n        System.out.println(\"hall call 6 UP   -> E\" + controller.requestElevator(6, Direction.UP));\n        System.out.println(\"hall call 7 UP   -> E\" + controller.requestElevator(7, Direction.UP));\n        System.out.println(\"hall call 1 UP   -> E\" + controller.requestElevator(1, Direction.UP));\n        runUntilIdle(controller);\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 5. Invalid requests ==\");\n        try {\n            controller.requestElevator(10, Direction.DOWN);\n        } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {\n            System.out.println(\"Rejected: \" + e.getMessage());\n        }\n        try {\n            controller.requestElevator(9, Direction.UP);\n        } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {\n            System.out.println(\"Rejected: \" + e.getMessage());\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static void advance(ElevatorController controller, int ticks) {\n        for (int i = 0; i < ticks; i++) print(controller, controller.tick());\n    }\n\n    private static void runUntilIdle(ElevatorController controller) {\n        int guard = 0;\n        while (!controller.isIdle() && guard++ < 100) print(controller, controller.tick());\n        System.out.println(\"all idle: \" + controller.status());\n    }\n\n    private static void print(ElevatorController controller, List<StopEvent> events) {\n        StringBuilder line = new StringBuilder(controller.status());\n        for (StopEvent e : events) line.append(\"   <- E\").append(e.elevatorId()).append(\" stops at floor \").append(e.floor());\n        System.out.println(String.format(\"t=%02d  \", controller.ticks()) + line);\n    }\n}",
