      "title": "Requirement 5 (extensibility): New pricing rules without touching the flow",
      "text": "Each rule is a decorator over another `PricingStrategy`, so rules compose in any order: a weekend surcharge adds 20% of the daily rate for each planned Saturday or Sunday, and a long-rental discount takes 10% off rentals of seven days or more. The reservation flow never changes; only the strategy handed to `RentalService` does.",
