    "text": "The driver walks the whole lifecycle: search, reserve, rejected overlap, a back-to-back booking, cancel, pickup and on-time return with a weekend surcharge, a late return with a declined wallet then an accepted card, a 10-day rental that earns the discount, and finally twenty threads racing for the same vehicle and dates.",
    "file": "Main.java",
    "body": "import java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.concurrent.CountDownLatch;\nimport java.util.concurrent.ExecutorService;\nimport java.util.concurrent.Executors;\nimport java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicInteger;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        // Weekend surcharge, then 10% off for rentals of 7+ days, on top of the daily rate.\n        PricingStrategy pricing = new LongRentalDiscount(new WeekendSurcharge(new DailyRatePricing()));\n        RentalService service = new RentalService(pricing);\n\n        Branch downtown = new Branch(\"Downtown\");\n        Vehicle eco1 = new Vehicle(\"ECO-1\", VehicleType.ECONOMY, downtown);\n        Vehicle eco2 = new Vehicle(\"ECO-2\", VehicleType.ECONOMY, downtown);\n        Vehicle suv1 = new Vehicle(\"SUV-1\", VehicleType.SUV, downtown);\n        Vehicle lux1 = new Vehicle(\"LUX-1\", VehicleType.LUXURY, downtown);\n        for (Vehicle v : List.of(eco1, eco2, suv1, lux1)) downtown.addVehicle(v);\n\n        Customer asha = new Customer(\"c1\", \"Asha\");\n        Customer ben = new Customer(\"c2\", \"Ben\");\n\n        LocalDate fri = LocalDate.of(2026, 10, 30);   // a Friday\n        LocalDate mon = fri.plusDays(3);\n\n        System.out.println(\"== 1. Search by branch, type and dates ==\");\n        System.out.println(\"Economy cars free \" + fri + \" to \" + mon + \": \" + service.search(downtown, VehicleType.ECONOMY, fri, mon));\n        System.out.println(\"Any car free in the same window:   \" + service.search(downtown, null, fri, mon));\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 2. Reserve, and the vehicle disappears from search ==\");\n        Reservation r1 = service.reserve(asha, eco1, fri, mon);\n        System.out.println(r1.getId() + \" \" + r1.getVehicle() + \" reserved for Asha, status \" + r1.getStatus());\n        System.out.println(\"Economy cars free now: \" + service.search(downtown, VehicleType.ECONOMY, fri, mon));\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 3. No double booking ==\");\n        try {\n            service.reserve(ben, eco1, fri.plusDays(1), fri.plusDays(2));\n        } catch (IllegalStateException e) {\n            System.out.println(\"Overlapping reservation rejected: \" + e.getMessage());\n        }\n        Reservation adjacent = service.reserve(ben, eco1, mon, mon.plusDays(2));\n        System.out.println(\"Back-to-back reservation accepted: \" + adjacent.getId() + \" \" + adjacent.getFrom() + \" to \" + adjacent.getTo());\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 4. Cancel before pickup frees the vehicle ==\");\n        service.cancel(adjacent);\n        System.out.println(adjacent.getId() + \" status: \" + adjacent.getStatus());\n        System.out.println(\"ECO-1 free \" + mon + \" to \" + mon.plusDays(2) + \" again: \" + eco1.isAvailable(mon, mon.plusDays(2)));\n        try {\n            service.cancel(adjacent);\n        } catch (IllegalStateException e) {\n            System.out.println(\"Cancelling twice rejected: \" + e.getMessage());\n        }\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 5. Pick up, return on time, pay by card ==\");\n        service.pickUp(r1);\n        System.out.println(r1.getId() + \" status: \" + r1.getStatus());\n        try {\n            service.cancel(r1);\n        } catch (IllegalStateException e) {\n            System.out.println(\"Cancel after pickup rejected: \" + e.getMessage());\n        }\n        Bill bill1 = service.returnVehicle(r1, mon);\n        System.out.println(\"Bill (3 days incl. Sat+Sun surcharge): \" + bill1.describe());\n        System.out.println(service.pay(bill1, new CardPayment(\"4242\", 500_00)).message());\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 6. Late return, wallet declined, card accepted ==\");\n        LocalDate nov3 = LocalDate.of(2026, 11, 3);\n        Reservation r2 = service.reserve(ben, suv1, nov3, nov3.plusDays(2));\n        service.pickUp(r2);\n        Bill bill2 = service.returnVehicle(r2, nov3.plusDays(4));\n        System.out.println(\"Bill (2 planned days + 2 late days): \" + bill2.describe());\n        System.out.println(service.pay(bill2, new WalletPayment(100_00)).message());\n        System.out.println(service.pay(bill2, new CardPayment(\"1111\", 1000_00)).message());\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 7. Pricing rule composition: 10 days gets the long-rental discount ==\");\n        LocalDate nov10 = LocalDate.of(2026, 11, 10);\n        Reservation r3 = service.reserve(asha, lux1, nov10, nov10.plusDays(10));\n        service.pickUp(r3);\n        Bill bill3 = service.returnVehicle(r3, nov10.plusDays(10));\n        System.out.println(\"Bill: \" + bill3.describe());\n        WalletPayment wallet = new WalletPayment(2000_00);\n        System.out.println(service.pay(bill3, wallet).message());\n\n        System.out.println();\n        System.out.println(\"== 8. 20 customers race for the same vehicle and dates ==\");\n        LocalDate dec1 = LocalDate.of(2026, 12, 1);\n        AtomicInteger wins = new AtomicInteger();\n        AtomicInteger rejected = new AtomicInteger();\n        CountDownLatch go = new CountDownLatch(1);\n        ExecutorService pool = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(20);\n        for (int i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\n            Customer c = new Customer(\"race-\" + i, \"Racer \" + i);\n            pool.submit(() -> {\n                try {\n                    go.await();\n                    service.reserve(c, eco2, dec1, dec1.plusDays(3));\n                    wins.incrementAndGet();\n                } catch (IllegalStateException e) {\n                    rejected.incrementAndGet();\n                } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n                    Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n                }\n            });\n        }\n        go.countDown();\n        pool.shutdown();\n        pool.awaitTermination(10, java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n        System.out.println(\"successful reservations: \" + wins.get() + \", rejected: \" + rejected.get());\n        System.out.println(\"ECO-2 free in that window: \" + eco2.isAvailable(dec1, dec1.plusDays(3)));\n    }\n}",
    "output": "== 1. Search by branch, type and dates ==\nEconomy cars free 2026-10-30 to 2026-11-02: [ECO-1 (ECONOMY), ECO-2 (ECONOMY)]\nAny car free in the same window:   [ECO-1 (ECONOMY), ECO-2 (ECONOMY), SUV-1 (SUV), LUX-1 (LUXURY)]\n\n== 2. Reserve, and the vehicle disappears from search ==\nR-1 ECO-1 (ECONOMY) reserved for Asha, status RESERVED\nEconomy cars free now: [ECO-2 (ECONOMY)]\n\n== 3. No double booking ==\nOverlapping reservation rejected: Vehicle not available for those dates\nBack-to-back reservation accepted: R-2 2026-11-02 to 2026-11-04\n\n== 4. Cancel before pickup frees the vehicle ==\nR-2 status: CANCELLED\nECO-1 free 2026-11-02 to 2026-11-04 again: true\nCancelling twice rejected: Expected RESERVED but was CANCELLED\n\n== 5. Pick up, return on time, pay by card ==\nR-1 status: PICKED_UP\nCancel after pickup rejected: Expected RESERVED but was PICKED_UP\nBill (3 days incl. Sat+Sun surcharge): R-1 ECO-1: $136.00\nCharged card ending 4242\n\n== 6. Late return, wallet declined, card accepted ==\nBill (2 planned days + 2 late days): R-3 SUV-1: $450.00\nWallet balance $100.00 is too low\nCharged card ending 1111\n\n== 7. Pricing rule composition: 10 days gets the long-rental discount ==\nBill: R-4 LUX-1: $1404.00\nDebited wallet, $596.00 left\n\n== 8. 20 customers race for the same vehicle and dates ==\nsuccessful reservations: 1, rejected: 19\nECO-2 free in that window: false"
